Since April, people have told us their bookings land on the wrong day: a month flipped. By
4 October the desk had **412 reports**.

**Merged as one issue, until 30 October.** The parser reads dates month first, and our tenants write the day
first. That fix is queued, but it is one of three problems in this ticket.

<Callout kind="warn">

Split on 30 October: #4471 holds three problems, each with its own ticket (table below).
The queued parser fix closes only one of them. Read [#4471 is three problems, not one](/kb/incidents/4471-split) first.

</Callout>

